        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana CH2525, Solid Brass Cabinet Hinge</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nMade out of solid brass, this Deltana made cabinet hinge is constructed to last. It measures 2-1/2 inches high and 2-1/2 inches wide. Sold as a pair, the Deltana CH2525 full mortise light weight door hinge comes packaged with matching solid brass Phillips flathead screws #7x3/4 inch. The ball tip finials come standard but they can easily be interchanged by any of the Deltana cabinet finials.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nDon't forget to look at <a href=\"/site/department.cfm?id=341823\">Deltana's Cabinet Hinge Finials</a> to spice up your hinges!\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<table width=\"300\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\">\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/del-CH2525.jpg?v=1704354599\" width=\"300\" height=\"335\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana CH2525 Specifications\">\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Deltana CH2525 2-1/2 Inch Square Hinges:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Height: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Thickness: .093\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Style: Full Mortise</li>\r\n<li>Screw: #7x3/4\" Phillips flathead screw (included)</li>\r\n<li>Sold as a Pair</li>\r\n<li>Finials: Ball Tip (included)</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-CH2525-specifications.pdf?v=1691095342\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana CH2525 Specification Sheet (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe PVD Polished Brass Finish (CR003) is recommended for harsh environments such as high salt or intense temperatures; it has the appearance of polished brass but without the ordinary problems such as easy tarnishing, discoloration, flaking, or pitting commonly associated with a standard polished brass finish.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold in Pairs (2 Hinges)</b>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "2-1/2 Inch Square Solid Brass Cabinet Hinge, Pair, Deltana CH2525",
                "description": "Deltana CH2525 Cabinet Hinge - Made out of solid brass, this Deltana made cabinet hinge is constructed to last. It measures 2-1/2 inches square. Sold as a pair, the Deltana CH2525 full mortise light weight door hinge comes packaged with matching solid brass Phillips flathead screws #7x3/4 inch. The ball tip finials come standard but they can easily be interchanged by any of the Deltana cabinet finials.",
                "keywords": "del-CH2525, deltana CH2525 2-1/2 inch cabinet hinges, solid brass cabinet hinges, ball tip finals cabinet hinges, light weight door hinges, kitchen hardware, cabinet door hinges, Deltana CH2525 2-1/2 Inch Solid Brass Hinges, bathroom hardware, vanity door hinges, sturdy cabinet hinges, full mortise hinges, extruded hinges,"
